# SVN revision diff
# Source: https://svn.code.sf.net/p/civ4betterai/code/
# Revision: 121
# Author: iustus
# Date: 2006-11-26T01:08:20.584708Z
# Coverage: full
# Message:
#   Major governor fixes:
#    - the main one would cause the governor to remove the worst plot and pick a nearly random one to use
#    - if you emphasize commerce, then specialists choose based on the commerce sliders (if you have 100% culture, you will get artists)
#    - generic citizens are worth 60% value, you should not get them instead of another specialist unless you emph production
#    - when production is marked dirty (like in financial crisis), do not stop building wonders (this may need to be tuned)
#    - likelyhood of building cheep building changed from 25% to 15%, it still happens perhaps too often
#    - canPopRush() added to player, it is a cached value
#    - AI players will no longer starve excessively (who changed that /2 to /8??)
#    - human players should no longer starve, even with emph buttons
#    - cases where a lower food tile worked with everything else the same fixed
#    - if you canPopRush, allowed to go one extra pop (to one unhappy basically)
#    - one production is now *slightly* less than 4 commerce (15 vs 16)
#    - emphasize buttons have a stronger effect, they should really do what you want them to do
#    - added (duplicate?) to case where it seems a duplicate trade message may be sent, if so, we can eliminate them
#    - trade deals messages were getting the who/from backwards in some cases. crash bug thats in 2.08 fixed
#    - the declare war assert added last build commented out
#    - AI_spreadReligion slightly sped up
#   
# Changed paths (7):
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvCityAI.cpp
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvDeal.cpp
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvGameTextMgr.cpp
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvPlayer.cpp
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvPlayer.h
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvUnit.cpp
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvUnitAI.cpp

